@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@accessToken = paste_access_token_locally
@resetToken = paste_reset_token_from_email_locally

### Login (HTTP client must retain Set-Cookie for refresh/logout)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@eris.example","password":"YourActualPassword123!"}

### Me
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Refresh — use cookie jar, not body refreshToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout

### Change password
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"currentPassword":"YourActualPassword123!","newPassword":"AnotherPassword456!"}

### Forgot password — requires SMTP configuration
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"staff@eris.example"}

### Reset password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"token":"{{resetToken}}","newPassword":"AnotherPassword456!"}

### ADMIN creates an internal account (not auth/register)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/user_register
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"staff@eris.example","password":"InitialPassword123!","fullName":"HR Staff","roleId":2}
